### List articles
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Open a basket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/baskets

### Scan articles (replace {id} with the basket id)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/baskets/{id}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "4001", "quantity": 3 }

### Pay by card
POST http://localhost:8080/api/baskets/{id}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentMethod": "CARD" }

### Pay cash
POST http://localhost:8080/api/baskets/{id}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentMethod": "CASH", "cashTendered": 10.00 }
